speechtext:
I have the tenders under my hand and I have a letter dated Winnipeg, Man., November 26, and addressed to the Inspector of Penitentiaries at Ottawa, as follows;
Dear Sir,-Inclosed we beg to band you out tenders for the supply of flour at the penitar-tiaries at Stony Mountain, Sapperton and Edmonton.
The tenders were sent in on the 26th November.
